## Context
Level 3 evaluation requires output provenance: claims attributed to
sources, confidence expressed, "I don't know" when uncertain. Can start
alongside Phase 3 once measurements table exists.

## Actions
1. Extend query methods to request source citations in prompts
2. Parse and validate citations in extraction step
3. Add sources_provided, sources_verified to RunRecord.justification
4. Scoring: fraction of claims with valid sources

## Exit criteria
- Query methods produce source-attributed outputs
- Extraction parses citations
- Justification fields populated in RunRecord
